{"seq":1,"slug":"data-sla-alerting","title":"数据 SLA 与告警体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/operations/data-sla-alerting","wordCount":1230,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据-sla-与告警体系\">数据 SLA 与告警体系</h1><p>质量检查发现了问题，然后呢？如果没有明确的 SLA 定义和有效的告警路由，检测到的问题只会淹没在日志里。数据 SLA（Service Level Agreement）将质量期望转化为可追踪的承诺，告警体系确保承诺被违反时正确的人在正确的时间收到通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据 SLA 与告警体系的设计要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多维 SLA</strong>：数据 SLA 不只是&quot;可用性 99.9%&quot;，需要覆盖新鲜度、完整性、质量、可用性、准确性五个维度</li>\n<li><strong>告警路由</strong>：按严重度和时间进行分级路由，确保关键问题不被噪音淹没</li>\n<li><strong>Error Budget</strong>：借鉴 SRE 的预算模型，将 SLA 容忍量转化为可消耗的预算指导团队行为</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sla-的三层定义框架\">SLA 的三层定义框架</h2><p>数据 SLA 不同于传统的服务可用性 SLA。它需要覆盖数据特有的维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SLA 类型</th>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>典型阈值</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新鲜度 SLA</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{now} - t_{latest\\_record}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ecor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>&lt; 30 min / &lt; 2 hour</td>\n<td>定时检查最新时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性 SLA</td>\n<td>实际行数 / 期望行数</td>\n<td>&gt; 95%</td>\n<td>与历史同期/上游对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量 SLA</td>\n<td>通过规则的记录比例</td>\n<td>&gt; 99.5%</td>\n<td>质量检查通过率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性 SLA</td>\n<td>数据集可查询的时间比例</td>\n<td>&gt; 99.9%</td>\n<td>探针查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准确性 SLA</td>\n<td>与权威源的一致率</td>\n<td>&gt; 99%</td>\n<td>采样比对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>SLA 定义的 YAML 规范</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# sla/orders_sla.yml&#10;dataset: analytics.orders&#10;owner: data-platform-team&#10;consumers:&#10;  - finance-dashboard&#10;  - ml-recommendation&#10;&#10;sla:&#10;  freshness:&#10;    max_delay: 30m&#10;    check_interval: 5m&#10;    timezone: UTC&#10;&#10;  completeness:&#10;    min_row_count_ratio: 0.95&#10;    comparison: day_over_day&#10;    tolerance_window: 2h # 允许批次延迟&#10;&#10;  quality:&#10;    critical_pass_rate: 1.0 # critical 规则 100% 通过&#10;    warning_pass_rate: 0.995 # warning 规则 99.5% 通过&#10;&#10;  availability:&#10;    uptime: 0.999&#10;    measurement_window: 30d&#10;    planned_maintenance_excluded: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># sla/orders_sla.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dataset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">analytics.orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">data-platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">consumers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">finance-dashboard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ml-recommendation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sla</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  freshness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    max_delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    check_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    timezone</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UTC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  completeness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    min_row_count_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    comparison</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">day_over_day</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tolerance_window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2h</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 允许批次延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  quality</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    critical_pass_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # critical 规则 100% 通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    warning_pass_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.995</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # warning 规则 99.5% 通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  availability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    uptime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.999</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    measurement_window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    planned_maintenance_excluded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"告警路由与升级策略\">告警路由与升级策略</h2><p>有效的告警系统需要解决两个问题：<strong>减少噪音</strong>（避免告警疲劳）和<strong>确保触达</strong>（关键问题不被忽略）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[质量检查失败] --&gt; B{严重度判定}&#10;    B --&gt;|Critical| C[立即通知]&#10;    B --&gt;|High| D[5分钟聚合后通知]&#10;    B --&gt;|Medium| E[1小时聚合后通知]&#10;    B --&gt;|Low| F[日报汇总]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; G{时间判定}&#10;    G --&gt;|工作时间| H[Slack Channel]&#10;    G --&gt;|非工作时间| I[PagerDuty 电话]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; J[Slack + Email]&#10;    E --&gt; K[Email + Dashboard]&#10;    F --&gt; L[周报]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; M{15分钟未响应?}&#10;    M --&gt;|是| N[升级到 Manager]&#10;    N --&gt; O{30分钟未响应?}&#10;    O --&gt;|是| P[升级到 Director]\">graph TD\n    A[质量检查失败] --&gt; B{严重度判定}\n    B --&gt;|Critical| C[立即通知]\n    B --&gt;|High| D[5分钟聚合后通知]\n    B --&gt;|Medium| E[1小时聚合后通知]\n    B --&gt;|Low| F[日报汇总]\n\n    C --&gt; G{时间判定}\n    G --&gt;|工作时间| H[Slack Channel]\n    G --&gt;|非工作时间| I[PagerDuty 电话]\n\n    D --&gt; J[Slack + Email]\n    E --&gt; K[Email + Dashboard]\n    F --&gt; L[周报]\n\n    C --&gt; M{15分钟未响应?}\n    M --&gt;|是| N[升级到 Manager]\n    N --&gt; O{30分钟未响应?}\n    O --&gt;|是| P[升级到 Director]</pre><p><strong>告警聚合规则</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聚合策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间窗口聚合</td>\n<td>同一规则短时间内多次失败</td>\n<td>5min 窗口去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关性聚合</td>\n<td>同一根因导致多规则失败</td>\n<td>按数据源/表分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抑制规则</td>\n<td>已知计划维护期间</td>\n<td>维护窗口配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复通知</td>\n<td>问题已自动恢复</td>\n<td>连续 N 次通过后发送</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gx-cloud-的告警能力\">GX Cloud 的告警能力</h2><p>2026 年 3 月，GX Cloud 增强了邮件告警功能，支持按严重度触发分级通知：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Alert Condition</strong>：按 Data Asset 配置，可选择&quot;任何失败&quot;、&quot;仅 Critical&quot;或特定严重度组合</li>\n<li><strong>Alert Recipient</strong>：支持多个邮箱地址，包括共享收件箱和系统端点</li>\n<li><strong>告警内容</strong>：失败的 Data Asset、按严重度统计的失败 Expectation 数、直达 Validation Results 的链接</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种内置告警适合快速起步，但大规模运营时通常需要与企业告警平台（PagerDuty/OpsGenie/VictorOps）集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sla-度量与追踪\">SLA 度量与追踪</h2><p>SLA 的价值不仅在于告警，还在于长期追踪和报告：</p>\n<p><strong>SLI（Service Level Indicator）计算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>满足新鲜度要求的检查次数</mtext><mtext>总检查次数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SLI_{freshness} = \\frac{\\text{满足新鲜度要求的检查次数}}{\\text{总检查次数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总检查次数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">满足新鲜度要求的检查次数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>passed</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>total</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SLI_{quality} = \\frac{\\sum_{i} \\text{passed}\\_i}{\\sum_{i} \\text{total}\\_i} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.446em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">passed</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Error Budget 模型</strong>（借鉴 SRE 实践）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Error Budget</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Error Budget} = 1 - SLA_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Error Budget</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如 99.5% 的质量 SLA 意味着每月允许 0.5% 的质量预算。当预算消耗殆尽时，团队应停止新功能开发转向质量修复。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预算消耗比</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 50%</td>\n<td>绿色</td>\n<td>正常开发节奏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%-80%</td>\n<td>黄色</td>\n<td>增加质量评审</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>80%-100%</td>\n<td>红色</td>\n<td>冻结变更、专注修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 100%</td>\n<td>超支</td>\n<td>事后回顾、根因整改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"告警疲劳的系统性对策\">告警疲劳的系统性对策</h2><p>告警疲劳是数据质量运营的头号杀手。当 on-call 工程师每天收到 200 条告警时，真正关键的信号会被噪音淹没：</p>\n<p><strong>对策一：动态阈值</strong></p>\n<p>固定阈值在数据有季节性波动时会产生大量误报。使用历史同期数据动态调整阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>threshold</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>same_weekday</mtext></msub><mo>±</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>same_weekday</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{threshold}(t) = \\mu_{\\text{same\\_weekday}} \\pm k \\cdot \\sigma_{\\text{same\\_weekday}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threshold</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">same_weekday</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7976em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">same_weekday</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取最近 4 周同一星期几的同一时段数据计算基线。</p>\n<p><strong>对策二：告警评分</strong></p>\n<p>为每条告警计算影响分数，只路由超过阈值的告警：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>impact_score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>severity_weight</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>downstream_count</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>data_volume_ratio</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{impact\\_score} = \\text{severity\\_weight} \\times \\text{downstream\\_count} \\times \\text{data\\_volume\\_ratio}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">impact_score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">severity_weight</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">downstream_count</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">data_volume_ratio</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>对策三：定期告警审查</strong></p>\n<p>每月审查告警统计：频繁触发但无人响应的告警应该被调整阈值或降级，频繁触发且有人响应的告警应该从根因上解决。</p>\n<p>告警触发后的诊断流程见 <a href=\"root-cause-remediation\">根因分析与修复</a>。SLA 体系的组织级推行策略见 <a href=\"quality-culture-process\">质量文化与流程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据 SLA 将质量期望从模糊的&quot;希望数据好&quot;转化为可追踪的量化承诺。多维 SLA 覆盖数据特有的新鲜度、完整性和质量维度，分级告警路由确保 Critical 问题在分钟内触达正确的人而非淹没在噪音中，Error Budget 模型则将 SLA 违反转化为团队行为的约束力。告警疲劳是这个体系的头号敌人，需要动态阈值、影响评分和定期审查来系统性对抗。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据 SLA 与告警体系","id":"数据-sla-与告警体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SLA 的三层定义框架","id":"sla-的三层定义框架"},{"level":2,"text":"告警路由与升级策略","id":"告警路由与升级策略"},{"level":2,"text":"GX Cloud 的告警能力","id":"gx-cloud-的告警能力"},{"level":2,"text":"SLA 度量与追踪","id":"sla-度量与追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"告警疲劳的系统性对策","id":"告警疲劳的系统性对策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Schema 契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/schema-contract-testing"},"next":{"title":"根因分析与修复策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/operations/root-cause-remediation"}}